Description: An experimental hard fork of the 'stringr' package with
    a private string backend copied from 'stringi' and being adapted to read
    and return 'ALTREP' character vectors through 'charport'. A simple R
    switch selects either installed 'stringi' or the private copy. The copied
    backend initially preserves stringi's ordinary materializing behavior so
    that semantic equivalence is established before 'ALTREP' adaptation.
